WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
And they want the factories to stop.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.760
Everything should stop. No more cows.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.880
We don't want cows anymore.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.300
I guess they want to kill all the cows.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.520
They want to do things that are just unbelievable.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.280
And you have it, too.

